    "body": "I think the use cases presented here are valid.\r\n\r\nAn alternative to `:will-define` is to add `:upgrade-failed`. If we're going with `:will-define` route, we should probably call it something like `:awaits-definition` since we never know if a given custom element will ever be defined or not.",
