    "body": "Yeah, fwiw, this was my original idea as well, but I tried to stay away from any actual proposals about solutions and stick to the use cases.  I believe @jonathantneal suggested these names based on a parallel with fonts. I guess I can let him speak for himself, but I belive that what he was trying to articulate was that perhaps there could be a desire that was \"more like fonts\" in the sense that maybe you want to say \"If I haven't defined it by this time, I'd like to show the user some fallback, even if it would be defined later\".  I'm not sure though.",
