    "body": "To confirm — Yes, you have correctly articulated my intentions, @bkardell. It was easier for me to describe my needs as pseudo-classes, because pseudo-classes were the [tool](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/:defined) I was given to work with. Similarly, you are correct that I have reasoned about custom element states as I have reasons about [custom font states](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@font-face/font-display).\r\n\r\nI appreciate that you’ve focused on the identifying on and agreeing on the issues. 😄",
